# Module server

Admin pages are not Nuxt file routes. Register them with `extendPages` on the `admin` parent (`runtime/pages/index.vue`, `layout: false`). Register handlers with `addServerHandler` under `/api/_miraicms/*`. Only `playground-nuxt/pages/` are file routes.

A mutating handler calls `requireUser`, then `requirePermission` or `requireEntryPermission`. Return `SafeUser`, never `password_hash`.

Schema changes go through `@miraicms/core` and update both SQLite and Postgres migrations in `packages/core/src/database/migrations`.
